  <name>Nook</name>
  <summary>Control your smart home</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.epogonii">
    <name>Evghenii Pogonii</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Nook brings lights, plugs, sensors, cameras, air conditioners, TVs and
      speakers together in one place. The Home page shows every device by
      section and room: switch lights and plugs on and off, and see the
      temperature, the doors and the leak sensors at a glance.
    </p>
    <p>
      It signs in to Home Assistant, Philips Hue, HomeKit, Smart Life, Mi Home
      and eWeLink, to the clouds of LG, Samsung, Mitsubishi Electric and
      Electrolux, and finds and pairs devices on the local network: Gree, Midea
      and Daikin air conditioners, Tapo and ONVIF cameras, Google Cast
      speakers, TVs, Sonoff and Shelly switches.
    </p>
  </description>

